{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t寒冷天氣警告及強烈季候風信號現正生效。<br/>\n<br/>\n受強烈東北季候風影響，本港氣溫顯著下降。截至下午四時，天文台錄得今日最低氣溫12.7度，是入秋以來的最低紀錄。<br/>\n<br/>\n天文台表示，今晚和明日市區最低氣溫約13度，新界再低幾度，明日日間最高氣溫回升至約21度。隨後一、兩日氣溫略為回升，到下周中期再度降溫。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:04:12.538925+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T18:57:54.862708+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:57:23.148391+00:00","content_hash":"88d9c5dffa7b022d3ee0ddb7bc5de7fd39e1a75870f2a625c4746a0bab8f2c30","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}